        "title": "About COVID-19 Hearing",
        "subject": "COVID-19 Hearing",
        "summary": "This was a U.S. Senate oversight hearing featuring former National Institute of Allergy and Infectious Diseases director Anthony Fauci, held by the Senate Committee on Homeland Security and Governmental Affairs (HSGAC). It occurred in the context of the committee’s continuing examination of federal handling of COVID-19 origins, related research, and government transparency; the selected timeline focuses on the immediate dispute over testimony and possible congressional enforcement rather than resolving the pandemic’s origin.",
