          {
            "label": "Witness",
            "value": "The hearing’s sole listed witness was Anthony Fauci, M.D., identified by the committee as former director of the National Institute of Allergy and Infectious Diseases, a position he held from 1984 to 2022, within the National Institutes of Health and Department of Health and Human Services.",
