          {
            "label": "Subject context",
            "value": "In a May 2026 HSGAC hearing on COVID-19 and gain-of-function research, the committee framed its inquiry around the origins of COVID-19, intelligence-community transparency, potential conflicts involving outside scientific advisers, and federal research oversight. Those are the surrounding issues for the later Fauci testimony, not findings established by the hearing itself.",
